# After typing a Navigator filter and erasing it, Enter goes to the entry the window opened on, the Starred view the pane shows.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report @star
	Launch:
		- Venue
END
keys gS <C-g>
type lau
see │▌   Launch
keys <BS> <BS> <BS> <Enter>
hide Navigator
hide Venue
see - Report 󰓎  Work
quit
